sequenceDiagram
    %% Actors and Systems
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Local as Local Environment
    participant Git as GitHub / Git Repo
    participant CI as CI / CD Pipeline
    participant Server as Staging / Prod Server
    participant DB as MongoDB Cloud

    %% Development Phase
    Note over Dev,Local: Development Phase
    Dev->>Local: Write Code (React & Express)
    Local->>Local: Run Linter & Local Tests
    Dev->>Local: Commit changes
    Dev->>Git: Push to feature branch

    %% CI/CD Phase
    Note over Git,CI: Integration Phase
    Git->>CI: Trigger Build Pipeline
    CI->>CI: Install Dependencies
    CI->>CI: Run Tests (Jest / React Testing Library)
    alt Tests Fail
        CI-->>Dev: Send Failure Notification
    else Tests Pass
        CI->>Git: Merge to main branch
    end

    %% Deployment Phase
    Note over CI,Server: Deployment Phase
    CI->>Server: Deploy Frontend (Vite Build)
    CI->>Server: Deploy Backend (Node.js App)
    Server->>Server: Restart Node Service
    Server->>DB: Run Database Migrations (if any)
    
    %% Monitoring
    Note over Dev,Server: Monitoring Phase
    Server-->>Dev: System logs & Error reporting
